        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Yes I was hesitating to post it here since it's a mix of the multiply operator and mini.comment and not really a minimal operator like those of this plugin. \r\n\r\n> For action on visual selection - not so much, but still doable. For full operator - not so much, as it should take a motion/textobject after itself.\r\n\r\nYes that's my main concern, it's not really that annoying for single lines,  it was just for the example but for more complex cases it takes significantly more efforts \r\n\r\n> I'll take a closer look, but not sure this will be made better in 'mini.operators' itself.\r\n\r\nLooking out for this if it's possible, thanks !\r\n",
